# Implementation Plan: Profile Page & Admin Database Settings

Implement a universal **Profile Page** for all users, an **Admin-Only Settings Page** for configuring Primary and Secondary databases with live connection testing, and update the **Top-Right** and **Bottom-Left** account menus with Profile and Settings icons.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Security & RBAC Enforcement**:
> 1. The **Settings Page** (`/admin/settings`) and all database management endpoints are strictly restricted to `ADMIN` users. Students, Course Creators, and Moderators cannot see the Settings icon or access database connection strings.
> 2. On the **Profile Page** (`/profile`), users may **only edit their Full Name and Profile Picture/Avatar**. Email, System Role, Department, and Account Status are read-only and managed by the platform.
> 3. Database URL updates will include a pre-flight connection test before saving, preventing invalid connection strings from disrupting the backend.

